{"unit_id":"Yuuz12__dsh-vision-helper#card-zh","repo":"Yuuz12/dsh-vision-helper","commit":"579ba35e1ff542bc9585f4810a5a88235bea8742","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-helper（DSH Web 插件）：为智能体提供可配置的图片分析能力。它注册 vision_analyze 工具，并在 Web 设置页提供视觉助手配置。主要功能包括读取本地图片或 data URI、调用多模态模型完成 OCR 和图像理解、设置模型参数，以及按需注入自动调用提示。适合需要分析截图、文档图片或图表的 DSH 用户。使用前需在 DSH 配置支持图片输入的模型提供方。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:326-438","lib/client.js:128-197"]}
{"unit_id":"Yuuz12__dsh-vision-helper#card-en","repo":"Yuuz12/dsh-vision-helper","commit":"579ba35e1ff542bc9585f4810a5a88235bea8742","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-helper adds a vision_analyze tool and settings page to DSH Web. It sends local images or data URIs to a configured multimodal model for OCR and image understanding. Users can select a model and adjust invocation guidance. Useful for inspecting screenshots, documents, and charts.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:326-438","lib/client.js:128-197"]}
