{"unit_id":"Yuuz12__dsh-vision-helper#feature-1","repo":"Yuuz12/dsh-vision-helper","commit":"579ba35e1ff542bc9585f4810a5a88235bea8742","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-helper 的功能「图片分析」：工具接收本地图片绝对路径或 image data URI，并把图片和用户提示交给所选多模态模型，返回文字分析结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:327-349"]}
{"unit_id":"Yuuz12__dsh-vision-helper#feature-2","repo":"Yuuz12/dsh-vision-helper","commit":"579ba35e1ff542bc9585f4810a5a88235bea8742","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-helper 的功能「模型选择」：工具读取配置中的 provider 和 model；未指定时从可用提供方中选择支持图片输入的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:351-357"]}
{"unit_id":"Yuuz12__dsh-vision-helper#feature-3","repo":"Yuuz12/dsh-vision-helper","commit":"579ba35e1ff542bc9585f4810a5a88235bea8742","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-helper 的功能「图片尺寸限制」：工具识别 PNG、JPEG、WebP 和 GIF，并在可解析图片尺寸时按 maxEdge 检查最长边，超限会提示调整配置或缩小图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:359-390"]}
{"unit_id":"Yuuz12__dsh-vision-helper#feature-4","repo":"Yuuz12/dsh-vision-helper","commit":"579ba35e1ff542bc9585f4810a5a88235bea8742","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-helper 的功能「Web 设置」：Web 设置页允许选择模型、调整温度、输出 token 上限、图片最长边及调用引导模式，并保存配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:39-115"]}
{"unit_id":"Yuuz12__dsh-vision-helper#caveat-1","repo":"Yuuz12/dsh-vision-helper","commit":"579ba35e1ff542bc9585f4810a5a88235bea8742","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-helper 使用前须知：需在 DSH 配置能够接收图片的多模态模型；插件自身不提供模型密钥，实际模型调用由所配置的提供方处理（见 index.js:351-357、index.js:413-420）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:351-357","index.js:413-420"]}
